This package adapts the Open Jungian Type Scales / Open Extended Jungian Type Scales by Eric Jorgenson.
Source: https://openpsychometrics.org/tests/OJTS/
License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International.

Adaptations include a Simplified Chinese translation, Agent interaction workflow, deterministic scoring implementation, original type-profile copy, original SVG documentation graphics, and AI-generated original character illustrations used in the README.

This package is not affiliated with or endorsed by Eric Jorgenson, The Myers-Briggs Company, or 16Personalities.
